LMCSytemCalc. Can be \\\"CentralAxes\\\" or \\\"WallMap\\\". \
\\n\\\"CentralAxes\\\" uses wall distance calculation using projection of the \
centarl axes and circular approximation of the ventricle. This method is \
fairly fast and uses CentralAxes internaly.\\n\\\"WallMap\\\" uses wall \
distance interpolation and subsequential gradient calculation. Can take long \
for high res datasets but is most accurate. Uses CalculateWallMap \
internaly.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
             StripOnInput->False,
             LineSpacing->{1.5, 1.5, 3.}],
            FrameMargins->{{10, 10}, {8, 10}}],
