diffusion weighted data diffdata to find edges that are not visible in the \
tensor.\\nEdge weights based on the diffusion data are averaged over all \
normalized diffusion direction.\\n\\nOutput is the smoothed \
tensor.\\n\\nAnisoFilterTensor[] is based on DOI: 10.1109/ISBI.2006.1624856\"\
\>", "InformationUsageText",
             StripOnInput->False,
