registers the data series using the given voxel size only using data within \
the mask.\\nRegisterDiffusionData[{dtidata ,vox}, {anatdata, voxa}] registers \
a diffusion dataset. The diffusion data is also registered to the \
anatdata.\\nRegisterDiffusionData[{dtidata, dtimask, vox}, {anatdata, voxa}] \
registers the data series using the given voxel size only using data within \
the mask.\\nRegisterDiffusionData[{dtidata,vox}, {anatdata, anatmask, voxa}] \
