label.\nHist[{data1..,data2,..}, {range1,range2,..}] plots a probability \
density histogram of the data from xmin to xmax with a fitted (skew)normal \
distribution. Uses ParameterFit.\nHist[{data1,data2,..}, {range1,range2,..}, \
{label1,label2,..}] plots a probability density histogram of the data from \
xmin to xmax with a fitted (skew)normal distribution and label as x-axis \
label.", "Documentation" -> None, "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> None, 
